   "text": "Entity resolution\n\nIdentity and Person stay per subgraph.\nlink adds SAME_AS between Persons\nwith the same verified email.\nWeaker matches are stored with\nmethod and confidence, not followed.\nA wrong merge is one edge to invalidate.",
   "originalText": "Entity resolution\n\nIdentity and Person stay per subgraph.\nlink adds SAME_AS between Persons\nwith the same verified email.\nWeaker matches are stored with\nmethod and confidence, not followed.\nA wrong merge is one edge to invalidate.",
